## Repository Folder Structure

- **`bietlejuice/`** — Python package: `base/airflow/dag_builders/` (~28 workflow types), `base/spark/` (`BaseCoreModelSparkJob`), `qube/jobs/` (Qube Spark jobs), `services/configuration_service.py` (env-aware config).
- **`dags/{domain}/{dag_name}/`** — every DAG has `{dag_name}_declaration.yml`, `queries/{layer}/*.sql`, `metadata/{layer}/*.yml` (CI-enforced), and optionally `data_quality/{layer}/*.yml` and `spark_jobs/` (core-model DAGs).
- **`packages/*/test/`** — unit tests mirror each package’s `src/bietlejuice/` tree (`test/unit/…`). DAG Spark jobs: `packages/bietlejuice-runtime/test/dags/…`; core models: `packages/bietlejuice-runtime/test/core_model_dags/…`; Airflow DAG modules under `dags/`: `packages/bietlejuice-airflow/test/unit/dags/…`.

**24 business domains**: `core`, `for_rent`, `for_sale`, `fintech`, `agents`, `growth`, `people`, `platform`, `qcx`, `3p_partners`, `cross`, `ds_pricing`, `governance`, `mlops`, `qube`, `support_and_service`, `tech_platform`, and others.

**Two special sub-structures:**

- **`dags/qube/`** — three-step pipeline, one DAG per step: `dimensions_{entity}_{name}/` (cron `0 5 * * *`), `measures_{entity}_{name}/` (`0 6 * * *`), `metrics_{name}/` (`0 7 * * *`). No `queries/` or `metadata/`; all logic lives in `bietlejuice/qube/jobs/`.
- **`dags/core/`** — canonical entity models (contract, house, offer, visit, listing). Custom Spark jobs in `spark_jobs/` plus JSON schema files instead of SQL; inherit from `BaseCoreModelSparkJob`.

